MolecularDynamics.textbookFormalModifiedExponential_coeff_two.{u_1} {R : Type u_1} [Ring R] [Algebra ℝ R] (A B C : R) :
  (PowerSeries.coeff 2) (MolecularDynamics.textbookFormalModifiedExponential A B C) = C + (1 / 2) • (A + B) ^ 2
MolecularDynamics.textbookFormalModifiedExponential_matches_product.{u_1} {R : Type u_1} [Ring R] [Algebra ℝ R]
